DevOps is not about learning everything at once.
It’s about learning in the right order. 🔥

A practical DevOps roadmap:

1️⃣ Linux Fundamentals
2️⃣ Networking Basics
3️⃣ Git & Version Control
4️⃣ Scripting (Bash/Python)
5️⃣ Docker & Kubernetes
6️⃣ CI/CD Pipelines
7️⃣ Cloud Platforms
8️⃣ Monitoring & Logging
9️⃣ Security Best Practices
🔟 Infrastructure as Code

Consistency beats speed in tech.
Master one layer at a time and keep building projects along the way. 


